    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a232db49fbcaacc2684ef856",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我觉得很在意，于是开始查起你的事情，\n发现你的经历实在非常厉害……\n就擅自产生了共鸣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0a50c3251aa178412469e8a830a35df941404e428d360b8da1607415a256a38",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
