    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44308c83af5b2076e8b01833",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我也一样。出生和成长\n都没有值得自豪的地方，这一直是我的心结，\n我也一直过着消极的生活──",
      "source_fingerprint": "34f3ffdb37701cd0cade8c1bd8de993ae23c56f87ca4e271b7182c18c2d41f21",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104117.json",
      "json_path": [
