    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb637977bed6ccc659663d5f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我不禁好奇“你还能坚持努力到什么时候呢”。\n基于负面的好奇心，我开始关注你。\n不过那时你却开始崭露头角──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac17e028b1b9217cfc45a26e50925e25d09066d10c8b61e44fe25b6973a9d126",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a89b0a0e8240110aa1782982",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（好……！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "05d39a51d9be5b07785787fc96f88ef222e244c9e30ee4ec68065f049a5e119e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104117.json",
