    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91346e1435a1bf3d28f02312",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──我知道了！\n反正机会难得就办一下吧，公开训练。\n感觉也能帮助我绷紧神经。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd0b81d9006c099fe3c6ab6b3ff152a287e6b63d75d05eb6f7159be18165a24f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104117.json",
      "json_path": [
