    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1600fda29af135bc563247d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于此同时──\n我开始觉得自己真的是太逊了……！\n居然用如此消极的原因追着你──",
      "source_fingerprint": "270cd43afe464340f81954a70e8f5a05a3619f88fc7d712e04cfb01673026a1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
